      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, very clean. I like the tone.\n\nActually, looking at my dashboard, the richness score for that draft came back a bit lower than I usually like to see for these top-tier listings. It's nothing major, but it feels a little \"lean\" on the descriptive side. \n\nCould you try a second version? Try to really lean into the sensory details—the textures, the light, the feeling of being there. Just a reminder though: please don't make it a mess of words. I still need it to read like a professional luxury brochure, not some AI-generated list of adjectives. Just make it feel a bit more \"lush\" while keeping that elegance.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
